## 2. TYPOGRAPHY

### Font Families
```
Heading Font:       "Poppins" (weights: 700, 600)
Body Font:          "Inter" (weights: 400, 500, 600)
Monospace:          "Courier New" (data, numbers, amounts)
```

### Font Scale
```
H1 - Heading 1:     size: 28px, weight: 700, line-height: 36px, letter-spacing: -0.5px
H2 - Heading 2:     size: 20px, weight: 600, line-height: 28px, letter-spacing: -0.25px
H3 - Heading 3:     size: 18px, weight: 600, line-height: 26px, letter-spacing: 0px
H4 - Heading 4:     size: 16px, weight: 600, line-height: 24px, letter-spacing: 0px

Body - Large:       size: 16px, weight: 400, line-height: 24px, letter-spacing: 0.5px
Body - Regular:     size: 14px, weight: 400, line-height: 21px, letter-spacing: 0.25px
Body - Small:       size: 12px, weight: 400, line-height: 18px, letter-spacing: 0px

Label - Large:      size: 16px, weight: 500, line-height: 24px, letter-spacing: 0.5px
Label - Regular:    size: 14px, weight: 500, line-height: 21px, letter-spacing: 0.25px
Label - Small:      size: 12px, weight: 500, line-height: 18px, letter-spacing: 0px

Caption:            size: 12px, weight: 400, line-height: 16px, letter-spacing: 0px
Overline:           size: 11px, weight: 600, line-height: 16px, letter-spacing: 1px, text-transform: uppercase

Amount (Mono):      size: 18px, weight: 600, line-height: 26px, font-family: "Courier New"
Subamount (Mono):   size: 14px, weight: 400, line-height: 21px, font-family: "Courier New"
```

### Color Rules
```
Heading (H1-H4):        #1F2937 (Neutral Dark)
Body (Large, Regular):  #374151 (Neutral Dark, slightly lighter)
Body (Small):           #6B7280 (Neutral Medium)
Caption:                #9CA3AF (Neutral Medium, lighter)
Overline:               #6B7280 (Neutral Medium)
Disabled text:          #D1D5DB (Neutral Light)
Link:                   #2563EB (Primary Blue), underline on hover
```

