## 3. SPACING & LAYOUT

### Spacing Scale (4px base grid)
```
xs:   4px     (small gaps, micro-interactions)
sm:   8px     (between icons and text)
md:   12px    (padding in small buttons)
lg:   16px    (default padding, section gaps)
xl:   20px    (larger gaps)
2xl:  24px    (between major sections)
3xl:  32px    (header/footer padding)
4xl:  40px    (screen padding)
5xl:  48px    (full-screen section gaps)
```

### Padding Rules
```
Card Padding:           16px (lg)
Button Padding:         12px vertical (md), 16px horizontal (lg)
Section Padding:        16px horizontal (lg), 24px vertical (2xl)
Screen Padding:         16px sides (lg), 24px top/bottom (2xl)
Icon+Text Gap:          8px (sm)
List Item Padding:      12px vertical (md), 16px horizontal (lg)
```

### Border Radius
```
Small Components:   4px (very small buttons, chip elements)
Buttons:            8px (standard buttons, input fields)
Cards:              12px (transaction cards, event cards)
Large Elements:     16px (full-screen modals, large cards)
Pill Shapes:        999px (badges, rounded pills)
```

### Layout Grid
```
Mobile viewport: 320px - 480px
Tablet viewport: 480px - 768px
Desktop viewport: 768px+

Safe areas:
  - Status bar: 44px (iOS) / 24px (Android)
  - Bottom navigation: 56px (with safe area)
  - Notch/Dynamic island: account for system-specific safe areas

Max content width: 480px (prevents awkward stretching on large devices)
```

