## 5. ELEVATION & SHADOWS

### Shadow Scale
```
Elevation 1 (subtle):
  iOS: -ios-shadow: { shadowColor: "#000", shadowOffset: {width: 0, height: 1}, 
                       shadowOpacity: 0.1, shadowRadius: 2 }
  Android: elevation: 2
  
Elevation 2 (cards, modals):
  iOS: shadowColor: "#000", shadowOffset: {0, 2}, shadowOpacity: 0.1, shadowRadius: 4
  Android: elevation: 4

Elevation 3 (floating actions, top nav):
  iOS: shadowColor: "#000", shadowOffset: {0, 4}, shadowOpacity: 0.12, shadowRadius: 8
  Android: elevation: 8

Elevation 4 (menu, dropdown, overlay):
  iOS: shadowColor: "#000", shadowOffset: {0, 8}, shadowOpacity: 0.15, shadowRadius: 12
  Android: elevation: 12

No shadows on interactive elements in disabled state.
```

### Best Practices
- Use shadows sparingly (max 3 levels in single screen)
- Don't use shadows on text elements
- On dark backgrounds, reduce opacity (0.2-0.3 instead of 0.1-0.15)
- Prefer subtle shadows for mobile (larger shadows look heavy)

