## 6. ANIMATIONS & TRANSITIONS

### Timing Functions
```
Fast:       150ms, cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)  (dismiss modals, quick feedback)
Standard:   300ms, cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)  (default transitions)
Slow:       500ms, cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)  (enter animations, page transitions)
```

### Common Animations
```
Button press:       scale: 0.98 (95ms)
Modal open:         slideUp 300ms + fadeIn 300ms
Modal close:        slideDown 200ms + fadeOut 200ms
List item remove:   slideLeft 200ms + fadeOut 200ms
List reorder:       scale 200ms + translate
Loading spinner:    rotate 360deg infinite (2000ms)
Pull-to-refresh:    rotate + scale down
Notification slide: slideIn from top (300ms), slideOut (300ms delay 2s)
```

### No Animation on
- Page navigation (use fade or slide, keep < 300ms)
- Loading indicators (use opacity transitions, not transforms)
- Text updates (no animation, instant update)
- Very fast interactions (< 100ms)

