## 8. DARK MODE (Future Implementation)

When implementing dark mode, swap these systematically:

```
Light Mode          →  Dark Mode
#FFFFFF             →  #1F2937
#F9FAFB             →  #111827
#F3F4F6             →  #2D3748
#E5E7EB             →  #4B5563
#D1D5DB             →  #6B7280
#1F2937             →  #F9FAFB
#374151             →  #E5E7EB
#6B7280             →  #9CA3AF

Primary colors remain the same (#2563EB, etc)
Text colors invert (dark on light → light on dark)
Apply 0.5-0.8 opacity to overlays (instead of 0.5)
Increase shadow opacity slightly (dark mode = more contrast needed)
```

