## 9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN

### Breakpoints
```
Mobile:     320px - 480px (default, focus here)
Phablet:    480px - 768px (test, auto-resize with max-width 480px)
Tablet:     768px+ (stretch to fit, use system safe areas)
```

### Rules
```
Max content width:      480px (prevent awkward stretches)
Column layout:          1 column (mobile), 2 columns (tablet+)
Card width:             full width - 32px padding
Font scaling:           no scaling, use fixed sizes
Icon sizes:             24px (standard), 32px (large cards), 16px (inline)
Touch targets:          always 48px minimum
Screen orientation:     support both portrait and landscape
```

---

## 10. IMAGE & ICON GUIDELINES

### Icons
```
Size:               16px (inline), 24px (standard), 32px (large), 48px (hero)
Stroke width:       2px (most icons)
Colors:             same as text (inherit color property)
Rounded corners:    2px on smaller icons, 4px on larger
Consistency:        use single icon library (Material Design or similar)
Filled vs outline:  outline for inactive, filled for active
```

### Images
```
Compression:        use JPEG for photos, PNG for graphics
Max quality:        80% (JPEG) to reduce size
Responsive:         scale images to device width
Background:         fallback color while loading
Aspect ratio:       16:9 or 4:3 (prefer consistent ratios)
Loading indicator:  show shimmer or skeleton (don't leave blank)
Accessibility:      meaningful alt text for all images
```

---

## 11. STATUS INDICATORS

### Payment Status
```
Pending:    ⏳ amber background, "Processing..."
Confirmed:  ✓ green background, amount shown
Failed:     ✗ red background, "Retry?" button
```

### Notification Status
```
Unread:     blue dot indicator
Read:       gray dot (faded)
Dismissed:  removed from list
```

### Sync Status
```
Syncing:    spinner icon, "Syncing..."
Synced:     checkmark, "Last updated: 2 min ago"
Offline:    ⚠ amber indicator, "Offline - changes will sync later"
Error:      red indicator, "Sync failed - tap to retry"
```

### Processing Status
```
Queued:     neutral gray, "Waiting to process..."
Processing: spinner, "Analyzing messages..."
Complete:   green checkmark, "Found X transactions"
Error:      red icon, "Parse error - retry?"
```

---

## 12. FORM VALIDATION

### Field States
```
Default:    border: 1px solid #D1D5DB
Focus:      border: 2px solid #2563EB, shadow: 0 0 0 3px #DBEAFE
Filled:     background: #F9FAFB
Disabled:   opacity: 0.5, cursor: not-allowed
Error:      border: 2px solid #EF4444
Error text: 12px, color: #EF4444, margin-top: 4px
Success:    border: 2px solid #10B981
Warning:    border: 2px solid #F59E0B
```

### Error Messages
```
Format:     "This field is required" (lowercase, specific)
Position:   below field, left-aligned, 4px gap
Icon:       ✕ in red, next to message
Color:      #EF4444 (danger red)
Animation:  shake on submit if invalid (200ms)
Clear on:   user starts typing, not before
```

